QWHaUh-o_IosbdSGW1ppvPNVkkke5xP1POFDgHzDIbFMA&oe=6B0EF50D"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1580571190361295", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619668_1580571193694628_8980407283017173942_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xSr--vKJFxAQ7kNvwEeUHtH&_nc_oc=Adq6YfnXX1NDkJlydUQaVuY9STUTQtU4oCG0SOhDuoqWey1ZMVKpS5A7R88U2pKS7Lo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXuqtJBsrzp_25VGr2TdrwqaEmFb2fVLwfyYAbYduJC8w&oe=6B0EF1B2"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "968844975974440", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622211_968844979307773_3876681594630402430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=31u068ifkogQ7kNvwHAvtnJ&_nc_oc=Adps6qoR79PsmOld4DWXnB_fokyXdtILZ34eze00w091zUv6KcriK9FNQ9rvBetIRLs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQU8eB4OF8STb6_uPkBseTJu0itQQn591QgI8enrtUKA3w&oe=6B0F0626"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Dragonboat VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Feel the Splash. Own the Harbour.**\n\nGrab your paddle, rally your crew, and step onto the docks of Hong Kong\u2019s most iconic waterway. **Dragonboat VR** captures the raw, blistering energy of traditional dragon boat racing and fuses it with hyper-immersive virtual reality. No button-mashing, no no life jacket\u2014just pure adrenaline, precise technique, and absolute synchronization.\n\nPlunge your blade into a breathtakingly rendered Victoria Harbour. This isn\u2019t a leisurely cruise; it\u2019s a high-stakes, sweat-inducing sprint through one of the busiest, most spectacular maritime arenas on the planet.\n\n\u26a1 **0% water. 100% power.**\n\nYou won\u2019t get wet, but your muscles will burn. Welcome to the ultimate digital sweatbox.\n\nKey Features\n- **Immersive Water Simulation**: Experience the harbor like never before. Powered by real-time fluid dynamics, every stroke interacts realistically with the environment. Battle the choppy wake of passing Star Ferries, fight the resistance of the tide, and slice through waves with physics-based precision.\n\n- **Iconic Victoria Harbour Race Track**: Experience the breathtaking intensity of racing between Kowloon and Hong Kong Island. Battle through daytime heats under a brilliant blue sky.\n\n- **True-to-Life Paddle Physics**: Your motion controllers are your paddle. True-to-life tracking monitors your entry angle, blade depth, and pull speed. Perfect your technique to maximize momentum and lock into the perfect cadence with the drumbeat.", "short_description": "Grab your paddle, rally your crew, and step onto the docks of Hong Kong\u2019s most iconic waterway. Dragonboat VR captures the raw, blistering energy of traditional dragon boat racing and fuses it with hyper-immersive virtual reality. No button-mashing, no no life jacket\u2014just pure adrenaline, precise technique, and absolute synchronization."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dreality.hk/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://dreality.hk/terms", "publisher_name": "Dreality Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://dreality.hk/vr-experience-production/dragon-boat-vr", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "79